'''Snow Miku 2021''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 590
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Snow Miku 2021
|name2 = Snow Miku CC 2021
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Snow Miku CC 2021''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Snow Miku 2021 should be used as a Long Distance attacker, and should be protected well. She has four knockbacks so she can survive a decent while, and has Strong against Traitless enemies along with a 50% chance to freeze them, which can be used to deal with backliners such as [[Mr. Mole]].

She does not have super high standing range, with 425 being lower than [[Master A.]], however she can reach up to 700 with her Long Distance attacks, so if there is enemies in front of it she can deal with it rather well. This unit should be used with lots of protection and meatshields, and can be used to deal with Traitless enemies really well.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Crowd-Controller}}

